  "priorExpiration": "2016-01-12",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3216.02 Auxiliary Driving Light/Fog Lamp Aim. A vehicle shall be rejected if the aim of the high intensity zone of the auxiliary driving lamps or fog lamps exceeds the limits imposed on the aim of the high intensity zone of the respective headlamp low beam.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes at Chapter Heading Saf-C 3200) #8915, eff 6-22-07, EXPIRED: 6-22-15\n\nNew. #10886, INTERIM, eff 7-16-15, EXPIRES: 1-12-16; ss by #11016, eff 1-6-16",
